#
# Free text lines -> products
#
VptopFreeLineTitle = Free text lines -> products
VptopFreeLineHelp = When a supplier order is validated, its free text lines (type product) are linked to a stock product: the product mapped to the same name below, or a new product with an automatic ref. The same product is set on the line of the customer order, so reception adds stock and shipment removes it. Names are compared without HTML, upper/lower case and extra spaces. Link similar names to one product here.
VptopFreeLineStatus = Automatic product on supplier order validation
VptopFreeLineUnmapped = Free text names without product
VptopFreeLineName = Name (free text)
VptopFreeLineSimilar = Similar names
VptopFreeLineGroup = Group
VptopFreeLineLinkSelectedTo = Link selected names to product
VptopFreeLineNewProduct = new product named
VptopFreeLineLink = Link
VptopFreeLineMappings = Name -> product mappings
VptopFreeLineApplyTitle = Apply mappings to past lines
VptopFreeLineApplyHelp = Sets the mapped product on free text lines of past documents (only lines with a mapped name). No stock movement is made: stock of the past does not change. Set the starting stock with an inventory.
VptopFreeLineApply = Apply
VptopFreeLineApplied = Lines linked to a product:
VptopFreeLineNoNameSelected = No name selected
VptopFreeLineChooseProduct = Choose a product or type the name of a new product
VptopFreeLineMapped = %s name(s) linked
VptopFreeLineSuggested = Similar to mapped product
